# Unblessed: Session watches through unwatch, Extend and Reload (#621); first blessing awaits human review.
# One commit reaches both matching watches. unwatch removes one, and
# unwatching it again does nothing. Declaring a new name extends the Script
# and keeps the watch; redefining the Handler reloads it, which removes every
# watch, until an Entry registers again.
> :grant scores store
> :clock virtual 2026-09-30T10:00:00Z
> on scoresChanged change, queued
|   say the "watch" of change
| end scoresChanged
> ask scores to watch "all", "", "scoresChanged"
> ask scores to watch "names", "name/", "scoresChanged"
> ask scores to set "name/ann", 1
[session/r4] all
[session/r5] names
> ask scores to unwatch "names"
> ask scores to set "name/ann", 2
[session/r8] all
> ask scores to unwatch "names"
> function double n
|   return n * 2
| end double
> ask scores to set "name/ann", 3
[session/r11] all
> on scoresChanged change, queued
|   say "changed " & the "watch" of change
| end scoresChanged
> ask scores to set "name/ann", 4
> ask scores to watch "all", "", "scoresChanged"
> ask scores to set "name/ann", 5
[session/r15] changed all
